  "description": "Sea surface temperature from NASA's MUR analysis (GHRSST Level 4 MUR Global Foundation Sea Surface Temperature Analysis, v4.1), as drawn by NASA GIBS, for a box about 1.6 degrees across, centred on Mauritius. The island is grey, which the app reads as no data. The picture for 2 February 2023 has no data at all, so the app plays the missing-data sound for it. Temperatures are read from the colours of the maps, so they are about, not exact.",
